# Agent/session memory — local only, pre-populated with real setup state.
# AGENTS.md is the tracked entrypoint; these files are local continuity,
# compatibility, archive, or audit state.
.claude/
docs/PROJECT_STATE.md
docs/campaign-1/HISTORY.md
CLAUDE.md

# Lesson-side working docs that should not ship to GitHub.
# AUDIT.md collects code-review findings raised during lesson writing —
# it's an internal queue, not teaching material.
# CONTINUITY.md is the lesson-plan tracker; same posture as HISTORY.md.
docs/lessons/AUDIT.md
docs/lessons/CONTINUITY.md

